  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><strong>馬匹數據原版</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">這個客戶端模组会在玩家的物品栏中显示马的数据（生命值、速度、跳跃高度）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">为了保持原版的简洁风格，设计得非常简单。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/d4rkm0nkey/HorseStatsVanilla/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/d4rkm0nkey/HorseStatsVanilla?include_prereleases\" alt=\"release\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/fzCg59vFkB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/823189930221240390\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/d4rkm0nkey/HorseStatsVanilla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/d4rkm0nkey/MinecraftMonkeyMod/actions/workflows/build.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"Build Workflow\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/310/795/horsestats.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"493\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/310/492/tooltip.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"203\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">现在包含未驯服的马匹数据！</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;padding-left:30px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tcf0WNNF35g?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;padding-left:30px\">HorseStatsVanilla 需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\">Fabric API</a>。</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center;padding-left:30px\"><br>若要更改此模组的配置，需要安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\">Modmenu</a>。</h3>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>最新版本更新：</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>4.1.7：</p>\n<p>- 移除强度提示，因为它始终为零。</p>\n<p>4.1.6：</p>\n<p>- 修复某些客户端下幼骡崩溃的问题</p>\n<p>4.1.5：</p>\n<p>- 修改模组文本颜色及高亮颜色</p>\n<p>- 修改优劣值的阈值范围</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>自3.0版起，速度以每秒方块数显示，跳跃高度以方块数显示。&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>本模组旧版说明：</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3>&nbsp;馬匹</h3>\n<p><br><strong>生命值</strong>范围为<strong>15-30</strong>半格血，平均倾向22-23。<br><strong>移动速度</strong>范围为<strong>11.1-33.8</strong>，平均约22.5。<br>⤏ 11.1等于4.8375方块/秒。<br>⤏ 22.5等于9方块/秒。<br>⤏ 33.8等于14.5方块/秒。<br><br><strong>跳跃强度</strong>在<strong>4-10</strong>之间，平均约为7。<br>&uArr; 9.7等于5方块。<br>&uArr; 7等于3方块。<br>&uArr; 4.3等于1.25方块。<br>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>驴子</h3>\n<p><br><strong>生命值</strong>范围为<strong>15-30</strong>半格血，平均倾向22-23。<br><strong>移动速度</strong>固定为<strong>17.5</strong>，即<strong>7.5</strong>方块/秒。<br><strong>跳跃强度</strong>固定为<strong>5</strong>，即1又9/16方块。</p>\n<h3><br>骡子</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>生命值</strong>范围为<strong>15-30</strong>半格血，平均倾向22-23。<br><strong>移动速度</strong>固定为<strong>17.5</strong>，即<strong>7.5</strong>方块/秒。<br><strong>跳跃强度</strong>固定为<strong>5</strong>，即1又9/16方块。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>羊驼</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>生命值</strong>范围为<strong>15-30</strong>半格血，平均倾向22-23。<br><strong>移动速度</strong>固定为<strong>17.5</strong>，即<strong>7.5</strong>方块/秒。<br><strong>跳跃强度</strong>固定为<strong>5</strong>，即1又9/16方块。<br>第四个数值表示携带箱子时羊驼的物品栏数量。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\">我將不會為這mod開發Forge版本，但你可以自行移植至Forge。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><br>功能需求？請發信給我或在下方評論。Bug請使用issue標籤。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms',geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在Github找到該項目 <a href=\"https://github.com/d4rkm0nkey/HorseStatsVanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>！<br>我在 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXae-p9MbuWI77waCw0HN6A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a> 上！<br></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
